    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "COMPANY PROFILE",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Pioneer Water Tanks (PWT) introduces you to our range of steel storage tanks. Corrugated and Flat bolted liner tanks are what we manufacture and distribute in the region. We have installed hundreds of tanks all over UAE and the Gulf region."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "region": "main",
      "src": "https://pioneertanks.ae/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/intro-img.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null,
      "width": 953,
      "height": 924
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "INTRODUCTION",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "text": "Pioneer Water Tanks (PWT) introduces you to our range of steel storage tanks. Corrugated and Flat bolted liner tanks are what we manufacture and distribute in the region. Our Tanks are Australian-designed using high quality materials and components including Zincalume steel structure and internal liners. We were the first to introduce Liner Tanks to the local UAE market back in 1993, our versatile products are of the highest Industry standards. Our Tanks come with the assurance that you will be getting a leak-free tank, with a long service-life, backed by a 10-Year Warranty. We look forward to service your water storage needs!"
    },
